                    # feel. The rail says which file overrules, and how much.
                    # ── AND WHAT A NAME WAS BEFORE SOMEBODY SAID OTHERWISE. Keyed
                    # by NAME, because that is where the fact belongs: the answer
                    # to "why is this colour different here" is owed at the value,
                    # in the table of the world that declares it, not as a badge
                    # on a file in a side panel. A panel that carries facts about
