                    "verdict": "holds", "refusals": [], "shared_repo_untouched": True,
                    "next": "nobody has written in your world, so it is not stored anywhere. "
                            "Open the bench and write a claim in my.swift: it is judged with the "
                            "shared world, stays out of it, and is kept on this machine alone. "
                            "Clear it again and it is gone."}
        # ── AND A FORMS ROW GOES TO THE COURT THAT READS IT, HERE TOO. This
        # handed every file of the world to the PLAIN court, and a forms page
